# SYNTHETIC — hand-written from RFC 1939 and RFC 2449, not a recording.
# The phase-0 capture against a real server has not happened yet.
# The fixture password is the literal s3cret. It is not a credential.

S: +OK POP3 server ready
C: CAPA
S: +OK Capability list follows
S: USER
S: SASL PLAIN LOGIN
S: UIDL
S: .
C: USER student
S: +OK student accepted
C: PASS s3cret
S: +OK maildrop ready
C: QUIT
S: +OK bye
DONE
